{"id":"591929088","kind":"article","title":"数学社区对于数学家应知应会的知识没有明确标准","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/The_mathematics_community_has_no_clear_standards_for_what_a_mathematician_should_know"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2022-12-15","updated":"2022-12-15","votes":12,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":505,"keywords":["数学学习","知识深度","间隔重复","Anki","数学研究"],"summary":"作者指出，数学家缺少共识来区分应当复习后遗忘、需要熟练掌握、或只需理解证明概要的知识深度。他提出可调查数学家实际掌握什么，并追问学习者如何判断哪些内容值得制成 Anki 卡片、数学研究者需要掌握基础学科到何种程度。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/591929088","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"CAN8xpSm\">数学家很不擅长区分（1）你应该仔细过一遍，然后抛之脑后的知识（2）你应该熟练掌握的知识，要达到有需要便能完整回忆起所有细节的程度，或者至少能回忆起主干，之后可以按需细化（3）你应该知道其表述或者其结果的知识，但你并不需要仔细研读证明，只要懂得证明概要即可。</p><p data-pid=\"dKykckP6\">如果能对数学家开展调查，测试出他们熟练掌握哪些知识，不知道哪些知识，那应该很不错。</p><p data-pid=\"YMFwDhb3\">我感兴趣的问题：对于数学知识，如何确定应该理解到何种深度。如果我在学习一些知识，如何能更优地做出判断，是否将其做成 Anki 卡片，或者将哪些部分做成卡片呢？这个问题当然取决于个人目标，但我想知道一些原则：比如说，如果我想成为数学研究者，我应该掌握分析/线性代数等学科到何种地步呢？很多人都会问这个问题，我觉得。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"g6CfoR3M\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_proof_review\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔证明复习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Spaced+proof+review\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"jH_cFqp2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Deliberate_practice_for_learning_proof-based_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">针对学习数学证明的刻意练习</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Deliberate+practice+for+learning+proof-based+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"j1LIFLeu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/The_mathematics_community_has_no_clear_standards_for_what_a_mathematician_should_know\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The mathematics community has no clear standards for what a mathematician should know</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔证明复习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"554633227\" href=\"#/post/554633227\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"591675068","title":"解释材料中假设了工作记忆容量是无限的","author":"Issa Rice","votes":33,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"592187312","title":"表示不可能的情况","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"707318570","title":"针对学习数学证明的刻意练习","author":"Issa Rice","votes":42,"minutes":8,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"554633227","title":"间隔复习数学证明","author":"Issa Rice","votes":20,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}